  // ABOUT US — complete page translation pass.
  if(path==="/about-us.html"){
    window.AnyBikePageLanguage.register({
      root:"body",
      translations:{
        en:{text:{}},
        de:{text:{
          "About AnyBike":"Über AnyBike",
          "A different way to buy and trade":"Eine andere Art, Motorräder zu kaufen und zu handeln",
          "UK motorcycles.":"UK-Motorräder.",
          "AnyBike is a motorcycle trading platform built to bring authorised UK motorcycle supply together with international retail buyers, international trade buyers and UK motorcycle trade customers.":"AnyBike ist eine Motorradhandelsplattform, die autorisiertes britisches Motorradangebot mit internationalen Käufern, internationalen Handelskunden und britischen Motorradhandelskunden zusammenführt.",
          "Unlike a traditional classified marketplace, AnyBike does not simply introduce buyers to supplying dealers. Where a transaction proceeds, AnyBike agrees the purchase, buys the motorcycle and resells it to the customer.":"Anders als ein klassisches Kleinanzeigenportal vermittelt AnyBike Käufer nicht einfach an liefernde Händler. Wenn eine Transaktion zustande kommt, vereinbart AnyBike den Einkauf, kauft das Motorrad und verkauft es an den Kunden weiter.",
          "Browse Motorcycles":"Motorräder ansehen","Work With AnyBike":"Mit AnyBike arbeiten",
          "How AnyBike works":"So funktioniert AnyBike","AnyBike is the buyer and the seller.":"AnyBike ist Käufer und Verkäufer.",
          "Our model is deliberately different from a classified website. The supplying dealer or seller remains confidential to the buyer, AnyBike handles the commercial transaction, and the buyer purchases from AnyBike.":"Unser Modell unterscheidet sich bewusst von einer Kleinanzeigen-Website. Der liefernde Händler oder Verkäufer bleibt gegenüber dem Käufer vertraulich, AnyBike führt die geschäftliche Transaktion durch und der Käufer kauft von AnyBike.",
          "1. UK motorcycles enter the AnyBike supply network":"1. UK-Motorräder gelangen in das AnyBike-Liefernetzwerk",
          "Authorised dealer feeds, direct dealer supply, private sellers and other approved UK sources provide motorcycles for AnyBike to assess, source and purchase.":"Autorisierte Händlerfeeds, direkte Händlerlieferungen, Privatverkäufer und andere genehmigte UK-Quellen stellen Motorräder bereit, die AnyBike prüfen, beschaffen und kaufen kann.",
          "2. AnyBike understands buyer demand":"2. AnyBike versteht die Käufernachfrage",
          "International buyers and motorcycle trade customers tell us what they need, or browse motorcycles already available through AnyBike.":"Internationale Käufer und Motorradhandelskunden teilen uns ihren Bedarf mit oder durchsuchen Motorräder, die bereits über AnyBike verfügbar sind.",
          "3. AnyBike agrees the commercial terms":"3. AnyBike vereinbart die Geschäftsbedingungen",
          "Where a motorcycle is suitable, AnyBike confirms availability, purchase terms, costs and the buyer proposition.":"Wenn ein Motorrad geeignet ist, bestätigt AnyBike Verfügbarkeit, Einkaufsbedingungen, Kosten und das Angebot für den Käufer.",
          "4. AnyBike buys and resells the motorcycle":"4. AnyBike kauft das Motorrad und verkauft es weiter",
          "AnyBike purchases the motorcycle from the supplier and sells it onward to the qualifying buyer.":"AnyBike kauft das Motorrad vom Lieferanten und verkauft es an den qualifizierten Käufer weiter.",
          "Experience":"Erfahrung","Approximately 40 years of motorcycle industry experience behind AnyBike.":"Rund 40 Jahre Erfahrung in der Motorradbranche stehen hinter AnyBike.",
          "The experience behind AnyBike spans approximately 40 years across motorcycle retail, distribution and transport. That practical industry background shapes how AnyBike approaches stock, dealers, buyers, collection, logistics and international transactions.":"Hinter AnyBike stehen rund 40 Jahre Erfahrung in Motorradhandel, Vertrieb und Transport. Diese praktische Branchenerfahrung prägt den Umgang von AnyBike mit Bestand, Händlern, Käufern, Abholung, Logistik und internationalen Transaktionen.",
          "Why we are building AnyBike":"Warum wir AnyBike aufbauen","Motorcycles should move more intelligently between markets.":"Motorräder sollten intelligenter zwischen Märkten bewegt werden.",
          "The UK has a large and diverse motorcycle market, while demand varies significantly by country and by buyer type. AnyBike is being built to understand that demand, identify commercially suitable motorcycles and move the right stock to the right market.":"Großbritannien hat einen großen und vielfältigen Motorradmarkt, während die Nachfrage je nach Land und Käufertyp stark variiert. AnyBike wird aufgebaut, um diese Nachfrage zu verstehen, kommerziell passende Motorräder zu identifizieren und den richtigen Bestand in den richtigen Markt zu bringen.",
          "Who AnyBike sells to":"An wen AnyBike verkauft","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers.":"Internationale Käufer und Motorradhandelskunden.",
          "AnyBike has a clear market boundary. International buyers can purchase privately or as a trade business. Within the UK, motorcycle sales through AnyBike are trade-only.":"AnyBike hat eine klare Marktgrenze. Internationale Käufer können als Privat- oder Geschäftskunden kaufen. Innerhalb Großbritanniens verkauft AnyBike Motorräder ausschließlich an den Handel.",
          "International Retail":"International","Private buyers outside the United Kingdom can buy suitable motorcycles from AnyBike for international delivery or export.":"Private Käufer außerhalb Großbritanniens können geeignete Motorräder von AnyBike für internationale Lieferung oder Export kaufen.",
          "International Trade":"Internationaler Handel","Motorcycle dealers, traders, importers and professional buyers outside the UK can source individual bikes or regular stock through AnyBike.":"Motorradhändler, Trader, Importeure und gewerbliche Käufer außerhalb Großbritanniens können einzelne Motorräder oder regelmäßigen Bestand über AnyBike beschaffen.",
          "UK Trade":"UK-Handel","Verified UK motorcycle dealers and traders can buy motorcycles through AnyBike, including dealer-to-dealer trading opportunities.":"Verifizierte britische Motorradhändler und Trader können Motorräder über AnyBike kaufen, einschließlich Händler-zu-Händler-Handelsmöglichkeiten.",
          "No UK Retail Sales":"Kein UK-Privatkundenverkauf","AnyBike does not sell motorcycles to the general public in the UK. UK motorcycle sales through AnyBike are for motorcycle trade buyers only.":"AnyBike verkauft in Großbritannien keine Motorräder an die allgemeine Öffentlichkeit. UK-Motorradverkäufe über AnyBike sind ausschließlich für Motorradhandelskunden.",
          "Explore Where AnyBike Sells":"AnyBike-Märkte ansehen","Tell Us What You Need":"Sagen Sie uns, was Sie suchen",
          "For motorcycle dealers":"Für Motorradhändler","A supply network and a buying network.":"Ein Liefernetzwerk und ein Einkaufsnetzwerk.",
          "Dealers can work with AnyBike in both directions: supply motorcycles and confidential Trade Prices to AnyBike, and use AnyBike to source or buy suitable trade stock from the wider network.":"Händler können in beide Richtungen mit AnyBike arbeiten: Motorräder und vertrauliche Handelspreise an AnyBike liefern und AnyBike nutzen, um geeigneten Handelsbestand aus dem größeren Netzwerk zu beschaffen oder zu kaufen.",
          "Dealer Opportunities":"Händlermöglichkeiten","Connect stock":"Bestand verbinden","Authorised stock feeds allow eligible dealer inventory to flow into AnyBike automatically.":"Autorisierte Bestandsfeeds ermöglichen es, geeigneten Händlerbestand automatisch in AnyBike zu übernehmen.",
          "Confidential Trade Prices":"Vertrauliche Handelspreise","Dealers can provide private commercial prices to AnyBike without exposing those figures publicly.":"Händler können AnyBike vertrauliche Einkaufspreise mitteilen, ohne diese öffentlich sichtbar zu machen.",
          "Sell to AnyBike":"An AnyBike verkaufen","AnyBike can purchase suitable motorcycles from dealers for international or UK trade resale.":"AnyBike kann geeignete Motorräder von Händlern für den internationalen oder britischen Handelsweiterverkauf kaufen.",
          "Buy through AnyBike":"Über AnyBike kaufen","UK and international trade buyers can source motorcycles through AnyBike from the same connected supply network.":"Britische und internationale Handelskunden können Motorräder über AnyBike aus demselben verbundenen Liefernetzwerk beschaffen.",
          "AnyBike Connect":"AnyBike Kontakt","Buy, sell, supply or work with AnyBike.":"Mit AnyBike kaufen, verkaufen, liefern oder zusammenarbeiten.",
          "Tell us whether you are buying a motorcycle, supplying stock, representing a dealership or looking for international motorcycle services.":"Teilen Sie uns mit, ob Sie ein Motorrad kaufen, Bestand anbieten, einen Händler vertreten oder internationale Motorradservices suchen.",
          "International Retail • International Trade • UK Trade":"International • Internationaler Handel • UK-Handel","Staff Login":"Mitarbeiter-Anmeldung"
        }},
        fr:{text:{
          "About AnyBike":"À propos d’AnyBike",
          "A different way to buy and trade":"Une autre façon d'acheter et de négocier",
          "UK motorcycles.":"des motos britanniques.",
          "AnyBike is a motorcycle trading platform built to bring authorised UK motorcycle supply together with international retail buyers, international trade buyers and UK motorcycle trade customers.":"AnyBike est une plateforme de négoce moto conçue pour réunir l'offre autorisée de motos au Royaume-Uni avec des acheteurs internationaux, des acheteurs professionnels internationaux et des clients professionnels de la moto au Royaume-Uni.",
          "Unlike a traditional classified marketplace, AnyBike does not simply introduce buyers to supplying dealers. Where a transaction proceeds, AnyBike agrees the purchase, buys the motorcycle and resells it to the customer.":"Contrairement à un site d'annonces traditionnel, AnyBike ne se contente pas de mettre les acheteurs en relation avec les fournisseurs. Lorsqu'une transaction se poursuit, AnyBike convient de l'achat, achète la moto puis la revend au client.",
          "Browse Motorcycles":"Voir les motos","Work With AnyBike":"Travailler avec AnyBike",
          "How AnyBike works":"Comment fonctionne AnyBike","AnyBike is the buyer and the seller.":"AnyBike est l'acheteur et le vendeur.",
          "Our model is deliberately different from a classified website. The supplying dealer or seller remains confidential to the buyer, AnyBike handles the commercial transaction, and the buyer purchases from AnyBike.":"Notre modèle est volontairement différent d'un site de petites annonces. Le professionnel ou vendeur fournisseur reste confidentiel vis-à-vis de l'acheteur, AnyBike gère la transaction commerciale et l'acheteur achète à AnyBike.",
          "1. UK motorcycles enter the AnyBike supply network":"1. Les motos britanniques entrent dans le réseau d'approvisionnement AnyBike",
          "Authorised dealer feeds, direct dealer supply, private sellers and other approved UK sources provide motorcycles for AnyBike to assess, source and purchase.":"Des flux de stock autorisés, l'approvisionnement direct de professionnels, des vendeurs particuliers et d'autres sources britanniques approuvées fournissent des motos qu'AnyBike peut évaluer, sourcer et acheter.",
          "2. AnyBike understands buyer demand":"2. AnyBike comprend la demande des acheteurs",
          "International buyers and motorcycle trade customers tell us what they need, or browse motorcycles already available through AnyBike.":"Les acheteurs internationaux et les clients professionnels de la moto nous indiquent leurs besoins ou consultent les motos déjà disponibles via AnyBike.",
          "3. AnyBike agrees the commercial terms":"3. AnyBike convient des conditions commerciales","Where a motorcycle is suitable, AnyBike confirms availability, purchase terms, costs and the buyer proposition.":"Lorsqu'une moto convient, AnyBike confirme sa disponibilité, les conditions d'achat, les coûts et la proposition faite à l'acheteur.",
          "4. AnyBike buys and resells the motorcycle":"4. AnyBike achète et revend la moto","AnyBike purchases the motorcycle from the supplier and sells it onward to the qualifying buyer.":"AnyBike achète la moto au fournisseur puis la revend à l'acheteur éligible.",
          "Experience":"Expérience","Approximately 40 years of motorcycle industry experience behind AnyBike.":"Environ 40 ans d'expérience dans l'industrie moto derrière AnyBike.",
          "The experience behind AnyBike spans approximately 40 years across motorcycle retail, distribution and transport. That practical industry background shapes how AnyBike approaches stock, dealers, buyers, collection, logistics and international transactions.":"L'expérience derrière AnyBike couvre environ 40 ans dans la vente de motos, la distribution et le transport. Cette expérience pratique du secteur façonne notre approche du stock, des professionnels, des acheteurs, de l'enlèvement, de la logistique et des transactions internationales.",
          "Why we are building AnyBike":"Pourquoi nous construisons AnyBike","Motorcycles should move more intelligently between markets.":"Les motos devraient circuler plus intelligemment entre les marchés.",
          "The UK has a large and diverse motorcycle market, while demand varies significantly by country and by buyer type. AnyBike is being built to understand that demand, identify commercially suitable motorcycles and move the right stock to the right market.":"Le Royaume-Uni possède un marché moto vaste et diversifié, tandis que la demande varie fortement selon le pays et le type d'acheteur. AnyBike est conçu pour comprendre cette demande, identifier les motos commercialement adaptées et orienter le bon stock vers le bon marché.",
          "Who AnyBike sells to":"À qui AnyBike vend","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers.":"Acheteurs internationaux et clients professionnels de la moto.",
          "AnyBike has a clear market boundary. International buyers can purchase privately or as a trade business. Within the UK, motorcycle sales through AnyBike are trade-only.":"AnyBike a une limite de marché claire. Les acheteurs internationaux peuvent acheter à titre privé ou professionnel. Au Royaume-Uni, les ventes de motos via AnyBike sont réservées aux professionnels.",
          "International Retail":"International","Private buyers outside the United Kingdom can buy suitable motorcycles from AnyBike for international delivery or export.":"Les acheteurs particuliers hors du Royaume-Uni peuvent acheter des motos adaptées auprès d'AnyBike pour une livraison internationale ou un export.",
          "International Trade":"Commerce international","Motorcycle dealers, traders, importers and professional buyers outside the UK can source individual bikes or regular stock through AnyBike.":"Les professionnels de la moto, négociants, importateurs et acheteurs professionnels hors du Royaume-Uni peuvent sourcer une moto ou un approvisionnement régulier via AnyBike.",
          "UK Trade":"Commerce UK","Verified UK motorcycle dealers and traders can buy motorcycles through AnyBike, including dealer-to-dealer trading opportunities.":"Les professionnels moto vérifiés au Royaume-Uni peuvent acheter des motos via AnyBike, y compris dans le cadre d'opportunités de commerce entre professionnels.",
          "No UK Retail Sales":"Pas de vente au détail au Royaume-Uni","AnyBike does not sell motorcycles to the general public in the UK. UK motorcycle sales through AnyBike are for motorcycle trade buyers only.":"AnyBike ne vend pas de motos au grand public au Royaume-Uni. Les ventes de motos au Royaume-Uni via AnyBike sont réservées aux acheteurs professionnels de la moto.",
          "Explore Where AnyBike Sells":"Voir les marchés AnyBike","Tell Us What You Need":"Dites-nous ce que vous recherchez",
          "For motorcycle dealers":"Pour les professionnels de la moto","A supply network and a buying network.":"Un réseau d'approvisionnement et un réseau d'achat.",
          "Dealers can work with AnyBike in both directions: supply motorcycles and confidential Trade Prices to AnyBike, and use AnyBike to source or buy suitable trade stock from the wider network.":"Les professionnels peuvent travailler avec AnyBike dans les deux sens : fournir des motos et des prix professionnels confidentiels à AnyBike, et utiliser AnyBike pour sourcer ou acheter un stock professionnel adapté dans le réseau élargi.",
          "Dealer Opportunities":"Opportunités professionnels","Connect stock":"Connecter le stock","Authorised stock feeds allow eligible dealer inventory to flow into AnyBike automatically.":"Les flux de stock autorisés permettent au stock des professionnels éligibles d'être intégré automatiquement dans AnyBike.",
          "Confidential Trade Prices":"Prix professionnels confidentiels","Dealers can provide private commercial prices to AnyBike without exposing those figures publicly.":"Les professionnels peuvent communiquer à AnyBike des prix commerciaux confidentiels sans les rendre publics.",
          "Sell to AnyBike":"Vendre à AnyBike","AnyBike can purchase suitable motorcycles from dealers for international or UK trade resale.":"AnyBike peut acheter aux professionnels des motos adaptées pour une revente internationale ou professionnelle au Royaume-Uni.",
          "Buy through AnyBike":"Acheter via AnyBike","UK and international trade buyers can source motorcycles through AnyBike from the same connected supply network.":"Les acheteurs professionnels britanniques et internationaux peuvent sourcer des motos via AnyBike depuis le même réseau d'approvisionnement connecté.",
          "AnyBike Connect":"AnyBike Connect","Buy, sell, supply or work with AnyBike.":"Achetez, vendez, fournissez ou travaillez avec AnyBike.",
          "Tell us whether you are buying a motorcycle, supplying stock, representing a dealership or looking for international motorcycle services.":"Dites-nous si vous achetez une moto, fournissez du stock, représentez un professionnel ou recherchez des services moto internationaux.",
          "International Retail • International Trade • UK Trade":"International • Commerce international • Commerce UK","Staff Login":"Connexion équipe"
        }},
        es:{text:{
          "About AnyBike":"Sobre AnyBike","A different way to buy and trade":"Una forma diferente de comprar y comerciar","UK motorcycles.":"motocicletas del Reino Unido.",
          "AnyBike is a motorcycle trading platform built to bring authorised UK motorcycle supply together with international retail buyers, international trade buyers and UK motorcycle trade customers.":"AnyBike es una plataforma de comercio de motocicletas creada para unir la oferta autorizada del Reino Unido con compradores internacionales y clientes profesionales de motocicletas.",
          "Unlike a traditional classified marketplace, AnyBike does not simply introduce buyers to supplying dealers. Where a transaction proceeds, AnyBike agrees the purchase, buys the motorcycle and resells it to the customer.":"A diferencia de un portal tradicional de anuncios, AnyBike no se limita a presentar compradores a proveedores. Cuando una operación continúa, AnyBike acuerda la compra, compra la motocicleta y la revende al cliente.",
          "Browse Motorcycles":"Ver motocicletas","Work With AnyBike":"Trabajar con AnyBike","How AnyBike works":"Cómo funciona AnyBike","AnyBike is the buyer and the seller.":"AnyBike es el comprador y el vendedor.",
          "Our model is deliberately different from a classified website. The supplying dealer or seller remains confidential to the buyer, AnyBike handles the commercial transaction, and the buyer purchases from AnyBike.":"Nuestro modelo es deliberadamente distinto de un sitio de anuncios. El proveedor permanece confidencial para el comprador, AnyBike gestiona la transacción comercial y el comprador compra a AnyBike.",
          "1. UK motorcycles enter the AnyBike supply network":"1. Las motocicletas del Reino Unido entran en la red de suministro AnyBike","Authorised dealer feeds, direct dealer supply, private sellers and other approved UK sources provide motorcycles for AnyBike to assess, source and purchase.":"Feeds autorizados, suministro directo, vendedores particulares y otras fuentes aprobadas proporcionan motocicletas para que AnyBike las evalúe, localice y compre.",
          "2. AnyBike understands buyer demand":"2. AnyBike entiende la demanda del comprador","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers tell us what they need, or browse motorcycles already available through AnyBike.":"Los compradores internacionales y profesionales nos indican lo que necesitan o consultan motocicletas ya disponibles a través de AnyBike.",
          "3. AnyBike agrees the commercial terms":"3. AnyBike acuerda las condiciones comerciales","Where a motorcycle is suitable, AnyBike confirms availability, purchase terms, costs and the buyer proposition.":"Cuando una motocicleta es adecuada, AnyBike confirma disponibilidad, condiciones de compra, costes y la propuesta para el comprador.",
          "4. AnyBike buys and resells the motorcycle":"4. AnyBike compra y revende la motocicleta","AnyBike purchases the motorcycle from the supplier and sells it onward to the qualifying buyer.":"AnyBike compra la motocicleta al proveedor y la revende al comprador que cumple los requisitos.",
          "Experience":"Experiencia","Approximately 40 years of motorcycle industry experience behind AnyBike.":"Aproximadamente 40 años de experiencia en la industria de la motocicleta respaldan AnyBike.",
          "The experience behind AnyBike spans approximately 40 years across motorcycle retail, distribution and transport. That practical industry background shapes how AnyBike approaches stock, dealers, buyers, collection, logistics and international transactions.":"La experiencia detrás de AnyBike abarca aproximadamente 40 años en venta, distribución y transporte de motocicletas. Esa experiencia práctica define cómo AnyBike aborda stock, profesionales, compradores, recogida, logística y operaciones internacionales.",
          "Why we are building AnyBike":"Por qué estamos construyendo AnyBike","Motorcycles should move more intelligently between markets.":"Las motocicletas deberían moverse de forma más inteligente entre mercados.",
          "The UK has a large and diverse motorcycle market, while demand varies significantly by country and by buyer type. AnyBike is being built to understand that demand, identify commercially suitable motorcycles and move the right stock to the right market.":"El Reino Unido tiene un mercado amplio y diverso, mientras que la demanda varía según país y tipo de comprador. AnyBike se está construyendo para entender esa demanda, identificar motocicletas comercialmente adecuadas y llevar el stock correcto al mercado correcto.",
          "Who AnyBike sells to":"A quién vende AnyBike","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers.":"Compradores internacionales y clientes profesionales de motocicletas.",
          "AnyBike has a clear market boundary. International buyers can purchase privately or as a trade business. Within the UK, motorcycle sales through AnyBike are trade-only.":"AnyBike tiene un límite de mercado claro. Los compradores internacionales pueden comprar como particulares o empresas. En el Reino Unido, las ventas son exclusivamente comerciales.",
          "International Retail":"Internacional","Private buyers outside the United Kingdom can buy suitable motorcycles from AnyBike for international delivery or export.":"Los compradores particulares fuera del Reino Unido pueden comprar motocicletas adecuadas a AnyBike para entrega internacional o exportación.",
          "International Trade":"Comercio internacional","Motorcycle dealers, traders, importers and professional buyers outside the UK can source individual bikes or regular stock through AnyBike.":"Profesionales, comerciantes, importadores y compradores empresariales fuera del Reino Unido pueden localizar motocicletas individuales o stock periódico a través de AnyBike.",
          "UK Trade":"Comercio UK","Verified UK motorcycle dealers and traders can buy motorcycles through AnyBike, including dealer-to-dealer trading opportunities.":"Los profesionales verificados del Reino Unido pueden comprar motocicletas a través de AnyBike, incluidas oportunidades entre profesionales.",
          "No UK Retail Sales":"Sin venta minorista en UK","AnyBike does not sell motorcycles to the general public in the UK. UK motorcycle sales through AnyBike are for motorcycle trade buyers only.":"AnyBike no vende motocicletas al público general en el Reino Unido. Las ventas en el Reino Unido son solo para compradores profesionales.",
          "Explore Where AnyBike Sells":"Ver mercados de AnyBike","Tell Us What You Need":"Díganos qué necesita","For motorcycle dealers":"Para profesionales de motocicletas","A supply network and a buying network.":"Una red de suministro y una red de compra.",
          "Dealers can work with AnyBike in both directions: supply motorcycles and confidential Trade Prices to AnyBike, and use AnyBike to source or buy suitable trade stock from the wider network.":"Los profesionales pueden suministrar motocicletas y precios comerciales confidenciales a AnyBike y utilizar AnyBike para localizar o comprar stock profesional de la red ampliada.",
          "Dealer Opportunities":"Oportunidades para profesionales","Connect stock":"Conectar stock","Authorised stock feeds allow eligible dealer inventory to flow into AnyBike automatically.":"Los feeds autorizados permiten que el inventario profesional elegible se integre automáticamente en AnyBike.",
          "Confidential Trade Prices":"Precios comerciales confidenciales","Dealers can provide private commercial prices to AnyBike without exposing those figures publicly.":"Los profesionales pueden proporcionar precios comerciales privados a AnyBike sin exponerlos públicamente.",
          "Sell to AnyBike":"Vender a AnyBike","AnyBike can purchase suitable motorcycles from dealers for international or UK trade resale.":"AnyBike puede comprar motocicletas adecuadas a profesionales para reventa internacional o profesional en el Reino Unido.",
          "Buy through AnyBike":"Comprar a través de AnyBike","UK and international trade buyers can source motorcycles through AnyBike from the same connected supply network.":"Los compradores profesionales del Reino Unido e internacionales pueden localizar motocicletas desde la misma red conectada.",
          "AnyBike Connect":"AnyBike Connect","Buy, sell, supply or work with AnyBike.":"Compre, venda, suministre o trabaje con AnyBike.","Tell us whether you are buying a motorcycle, supplying stock, representing a dealership or looking for international motorcycle services.":"Díganos si compra una motocicleta, suministra stock, representa a un profesional o busca servicios internacionales.",
          "International Retail • International Trade • UK Trade":"Internacional • Comercio internacional • Comercio UK","Staff Login":"Acceso del personal"
        }},
        ar:{text:{
          "About AnyBike":"عن AnyBike","A different way to buy and trade":"طريقة مختلفة لشراء وتجارة","UK motorcycles.":"الدراجات البريطانية.",
          "AnyBike is a motorcycle trading platform built to bring authorised UK motorcycle supply together with international retail buyers, international trade buyers and UK motorcycle trade customers.":"AnyBike منصة لتجارة الدراجات تجمع المعروض البريطاني المعتمد مع المشترين الدوليين وعملاء تجارة الدراجات.",
          "Unlike a traditional classified marketplace, AnyBike does not simply introduce buyers to supplying dealers. Where a transaction proceeds, AnyBike agrees the purchase, buys the motorcycle and resells it to the customer.":"على خلاف مواقع الإعلانات التقليدية، لا تكتفي AnyBike بتعريف المشترين بالموردين. عند إتمام الصفقة توافق AnyBike على الشراء، وتشتري الدراجة ثم تعيد بيعها للعميل.",
          "Browse Motorcycles":"تصفح الدراجات","Work With AnyBike":"اعمل مع AnyBike","How AnyBike works":"كيف تعمل AnyBike","AnyBike is the buyer and the seller.":"AnyBike هي المشتري والبائع.",
          "Our model is deliberately different from a classified website. The supplying dealer or seller remains confidential to the buyer, AnyBike handles the commercial transaction, and the buyer purchases from AnyBike.":"يختلف نموذجنا عمداً عن مواقع الإعلانات. يبقى المورد سرياً بالنسبة للمشتري، وتتولى AnyBike المعاملة التجارية ويشتري العميل من AnyBike.",
          "1. UK motorcycles enter the AnyBike supply network":"1. تدخل الدراجات البريطانية شبكة توريد AnyBike","Authorised dealer feeds, direct dealer supply, private sellers and other approved UK sources provide motorcycles for AnyBike to assess, source and purchase.":"توفر تغذيات التجار المعتمدة والموردون المباشرون والبائعون الأفراد ومصادر بريطانية معتمدة أخرى دراجات لتقييمها وشرائها عبر AnyBike.",
          "2. AnyBike understands buyer demand":"2. تفهم AnyBike طلب المشترين","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers tell us what they need, or browse motorcycles already available through AnyBike.":"يخبرنا المشترون الدوليون وعملاء التجارة بما يحتاجونه أو يتصفحون الدراجات المتاحة بالفعل عبر AnyBike.",
          "3. AnyBike agrees the commercial terms":"3. توافق AnyBike على الشروط التجارية","Where a motorcycle is suitable, AnyBike confirms availability, purchase terms, costs and the buyer proposition.":"عندما تكون الدراجة مناسبة تؤكد AnyBike التوفر وشروط الشراء والتكاليف والعرض للمشتري.",
          "4. AnyBike buys and resells the motorcycle":"4. تشتري AnyBike الدراجة وتعيد بيعها","AnyBike purchases the motorcycle from the supplier and sells it onward to the qualifying buyer.":"تشتري AnyBike الدراجة من المورد ثم تبيعها للمشتري المؤهل.",
          "Experience":"الخبرة","Approximately 40 years of motorcycle industry experience behind AnyBike.":"تقف وراء AnyBike خبرة تقارب 40 عاماً في صناعة الدراجات.",
          "The experience behind AnyBike spans approximately 40 years across motorcycle retail, distribution and transport. That practical industry background shapes how AnyBike approaches stock, dealers, buyers, collection, logistics and international transactions.":"تمتد خبرة AnyBike لنحو 40 عاماً في بيع الدراجات وتوزيعها ونقلها، وهذه الخبرة العملية تشكل طريقة تعاملنا مع المخزون والتجار والمشترين والاستلام والخدمات اللوجستية والمعاملات الدولية.",
          "Why we are building AnyBike":"لماذا نبني AnyBike","Motorcycles should move more intelligently between markets.":"ينبغي أن تنتقل الدراجات بذكاء أكبر بين الأسواق.",
          "The UK has a large and diverse motorcycle market, while demand varies significantly by country and by buyer type. AnyBike is being built to understand that demand, identify commercially suitable motorcycles and move the right stock to the right market.":"لدى المملكة المتحدة سوق كبير ومتنوّع للدراجات، بينما يختلف الطلب باختلاف البلد ونوع المشتري. تُبنى AnyBike لفهم هذا الطلب وتحديد الدراجات المناسبة تجارياً ونقل المخزون الصحيح إلى السوق الصحيح.",
          "Who AnyBike sells to":"لمن تبيع AnyBike","International buyers and motorcycle trade customers.":"المشترون الدوليون وعملاء تجارة الدراجات.","AnyBike has a clear market boundary. International buyers can purchase privately or as a trade business. Within the UK, motorcycle sales through AnyBike are trade-only.":"لدى AnyBike حدود سوق واضحة. يمكن للمشترين الدوليين الشراء كأفراد أو تجار، بينما المبيعات داخل المملكة المتحدة للتجارة فقط.",
          "International Retail":"دولي","Private buyers outside the United Kingdom can buy suitable motorcycles from AnyBike for international delivery or export.":"يمكن للمشترين الأفراد خارج المملكة المتحدة شراء دراجات مناسبة من AnyBike للتسليم الدولي أو التصدير.",
          "International Trade":"تجارة دولية","Motorcycle dealers, traders, importers and professional buyers outside the UK can source individual bikes or regular stock through AnyBike.":"يمكن للتجار والمستوردين والمشترين المحترفين خارج المملكة المتحدة الحصول على دراجات فردية أو مخزون منتظم عبر AnyBike.",
          "UK Trade":"تجارة المملكة المتحدة","Verified UK motorcycle dealers and traders can buy motorcycles through AnyBike, including dealer-to-dealer trading opportunities.":"يمكن لتجار الدراجات المعتمدين في المملكة المتحدة شراء الدراجات عبر AnyBike بما في ذلك فرص التجارة بين التجار.",
          "No UK Retail Sales":"لا مبيعات تجزئة داخل المملكة المتحدة","AnyBike does not sell motorcycles to the general public in the UK. UK motorcycle sales through AnyBike are for motorcycle trade buyers only.":"لا تبيع AnyBike الدراجات لعامة الجمهور داخل المملكة المتحدة. المبيعات البريطانية مخصصة للمشترين التجاريين فقط.",
          "Explore Where AnyBike Sells":"استكشف أسواق AnyBike","Tell Us What You Need":"أخبرنا بما تحتاجه","For motorcycle dealers":"لتجار الدراجات","A supply network and a buying network.":"شبكة توريد وشبكة شراء.",
          "Dealers can work with AnyBike in both directions: supply motorcycles and confidential Trade Prices to AnyBike, and use AnyBike to source or buy suitable trade stock from the wider network.":"يمكن للتجار العمل مع AnyBike في الاتجاهين: توريد الدراجات والأسعار التجارية السرية، واستخدام AnyBike للعثور على مخزون تجاري مناسب أو شرائه.",
          "Dealer Opportunities":"فرص التجار","Connect stock":"ربط المخزون","Authorised stock feeds allow eligible dealer inventory to flow into AnyBike automatically.":"تسمح تغذيات المخزون المعتمدة بتدفق مخزون التجار المؤهلين إلى AnyBike تلقائياً.",
          "Confidential Trade Prices":"أسعار تجارة سرية","Dealers can provide private commercial prices to AnyBike without exposing those figures publicly.":"يمكن للتجار تزويد AnyBike بأسعار تجارية خاصة دون عرضها علناً.",
          "Sell to AnyBike":"بع إلى AnyBike","AnyBike can purchase suitable motorcycles from dealers for international or UK trade resale.":"يمكن لـ AnyBike شراء دراجات مناسبة من التجار لإعادة بيعها دولياً أو في تجارة المملكة المتحدة.",
          "Buy through AnyBike":"اشتر عبر AnyBike","UK and international trade buyers can source motorcycles through AnyBike from the same connected supply network.":"يمكن للمشترين التجاريين في المملكة المتحدة ودولياً الحصول على الدراجات من نفس شبكة التوريد المتصلة عبر AnyBike.",
          "AnyBike Connect":"AnyBike Connect","Buy, sell, supply or work with AnyBike.":"اشترِ أو بع أو ورّد أو اعمل مع AnyBike.","Tell us whether you are buying a motorcycle, supplying stock, representing a dealership or looking for international motorcycle services.":"أخبرنا إن كنت تشتري دراجة أو تورّد مخزوناً أو تمثل وكالة أو تبحث عن خدمات دراجات دولية.",
          "International Retail • International Trade • UK Trade":"دولي • تجارة دولية • تجارة المملكة المتحدة","Staff Login":"دخول الموظفين"
        }}
      }
    });
  }

